  <p id="c-chenshu-019-shenjiong-grandfather:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-019-shenjiong-grandfather:p001:m0000" ref="j6f_ufq_av2_AA">沈炯</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-019-shenjiong-grandfather:p001:m0003" ref="j6f_ufq_av2_AA">禮明</persName>，吳興武康人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-019-shenjiong-grandfather:p001:m0014" ref="j6f_ufq_av2">瑀</persName>，梁尋陽太守。父<persName id="c-chenshu-019-shenjiong-grandfather:p001:m0023" ref="j6f_ufq_av2_A">續</persName>，王府記室參軍。</p>
